    {
      "path": "cordis.patch.yml",
      "text": "# 补丁按整行配置替换；同时启用本插件的搜索与抓取提供方。\n#\n# - 搜索：`free-first`（沿用既有 id，安装与设置无需迁移）\n# - 抓取：`local-first`（官方 http 插件已占用 `http`，不能用同名覆盖）\n# 若你已自定义 fetchProvider，请把本补丁里的 fetchProvider 改回你的选择。\n- insert:\n    - id: web-search\n      name: dsh-web-search\n      config:\n        allowBillable: false\n        timeoutMs: 25000\n        totalTimeoutMs: 90000\n        maxResponseBytes: 5242880\n        maxChars: 24000\n        retries: 1\n        fetchTimeoutMs: 20000\n        fetchMaxResponseBytes: 5242880\n        fetchMaxChars: 24000\n        fetchMaxRedirects: 3\n\n- id: web\n  config:\n    searchProvider: free-first\n    fetchProvider: local-first\n"
    }
